Current Dream Flow
------------------

DREAM ACTIVATION DISABLED

Player uses bed
↓
Dream mod does nothing
↓
Vanilla Minecraft handles sleeping normally


DREAM ACTIVATION ENABLED

Player uses bed
↓
Vanilla evaluates whether sleeping is allowed
↓
If vanilla rejects sleep:
    Dream does not start

If vanilla accepts sleep:
    Player briefly enters valid vanilla sleep
    ↓
    Vanilla sleep stats / advancement behavior occurs
    ↓
    Dream mod stops normal sleep
    ↓
    DreamService.enterDream(...)
    ↓
    Player enters dream:dream


